{"id":"multi-llm-routing-ensemble-I0001","kind":"insight","unit":"multi-llm-routing-ensemble","unit_name":"多模型路由、级联与集成","statement":"缺少干净参考信号的语音增强可以通过无参考质量估计选择更适合当前输入的专用模型，尤其在高输入信噪比下改善增强效果。","mechanism":"预测各专用模型输出的无参考质量并选择最佳者。","scope":"多个专用语音增强模型之间的选择；依赖质量估计可靠性。","techniques":[{"name":"specialized speech enhancement model selection (SSEMS)","papers":[152306]},{"name":"Quality-Net","papers":[152306]}],"supporting_papers":[152306],"paper_count":1}
{"id":"multi-llm-routing-ensemble-I0003","kind":"insight","unit":"multi-llm-routing-ensemble","unit_name":"多模型路由、级联与集成","statement":"预算受限的多标签分类可以依据输入自适应选择并组合预测API，在不枚举所有标签组合的情况下改善准确率与成本权衡。","mechanism":"估计追加API调用的准确率增益，并结合成本和剩余预算选择调用组合。","scope":"具有已知API成本和带标签训练数据的在线多标签分类。","techniques":[{"name":"FrugalMCT","papers":[87188]}],"supporting_papers":[87188],"paper_count":1}
{"id":"multi-llm-routing-ensemble-I0013","kind":"insight","unit":"multi-llm-routing-ensemble","unit_name":"多模型路由、级联与集成","statement":"异构黑盒模型之间学习输出空间映射后，可以在预算受限的协同推理中由已执行模型推断其他模型信息，从而减少实际计算并保持较高准确率。","mechanism":"学习跨模型输出关联并据此预测、调度后续执行。","scope":"预算约束下的异构黑盒协同推理；需要可学习的输出关联。","techniques":[{"name":"MLink","papers":[413897]},{"name":"model links","papers":[413897]}],"supporting_papers":[413897],"paper_count":1}
{"id":"multi-llm-routing-ensemble-I0015","kind":"insight","unit":"multi-llm-routing-ensemble","unit_name":"多模型路由、级联与集成","statement":"数据集级或生产任务的离线模型选择可以先用历史表现或低成本信号筛选候选，再把探测和高保真评估集中于潜力模型，以降低选择成本并保持部署质量。","mechanism":"逐步提高评估保真度，将测评资源集中于有潜力的候选。","scope":"预训练模型推荐与大规模微调LLM部署选择；不涉及逐请求路由或组合配置搜索。","techniques":[{"name":"ModsNet","papers":[143967]},{"name":"ModelLens","papers":[200571]},{"name":"AgentRec","papers":[298328]},{"name":"多阶段检索与排序","papers":[298328]},{"name":"逐步提高保真度的模型评估","papers":[298328]}],"supporting_papers":[143967,200571,298328],"paper_count":3}
{"id":"multi-llm-routing-ensemble-I0016","kind":"insight","unit":"multi-llm-routing-ensemble","unit_name":"多模型路由、级联与集成","statement":"表格模型推理可以联合复用历史查询结果和按查询选择模型，在重复查询带来缓存命中时节省计算，在未命中时利用模型成本差异降低总体推理成本。","mechanism":"缓存命中则复用结果，否则选择适合的模型，并联合优化两者。","scope":"存在重复查询和多个候选模型的离线及在线表格推理。","techniques":[{"name":"联合缓存与模型选择算法","papers":[196506]},{"name":"GDSF","papers":[196506]},{"name":"LEC","papers":[196506]}],"supporting_papers":[196506],"paper_count":1}
{"id":"multi-llm-routing-ensemble-I0017","kind":"insight","unit":"multi-llm-routing-ensemble","unit_name":"多模型路由、级联与集成","statement":"多个LLM或同一模型的多个提示，其输出可在文本、词元分布或离散答案层面融合：按候选质量排序改写、按权重混合采样或按模型可靠性与相关性加权，通常优于单模型与多数投票（LLM-Blender、MoA、M-Ped、SkillAggregation）。","mechanism":"建立跨输出（文本、词元分布、离散答案）的可比较联系，按质量、概率或可靠性权重保留互补信息。","scope":"开放式生成与封闭式问答；需要可访问概率、可靠的质量估计或带标签校准数据；贪心解码或成员错误高度相关时收益下降。","techniques":[{"name":"LLM-Blender","papers":[237185]},{"name":"PairRanker","papers":[237185]},{"name":"GenFuser","papers":[237185]},{"name":"LLM-TOPLA","papers":[63422]},{"name":"Unified Ranking and Generation（URG）","papers":[228760]},{"name":"Mixture-of-Agents（MoA）","papers":[248694]},{"name":"Diverse Fingerprint Ensemble（DFPE）","papers":[164942]},{"name":"基于二部因子图的语义层集成与消息传递框架","papers":[206826]},{"name":"Fusion-of-N（FusioN；结构化正文亦简称 FoN）","papers":[258521]},{"name":"LM-Corrector（LMCor）","papers":[163837]},{"name":"Cappy（Continual Pretraining with a lightweight Scorer）","papers":[196497]},{"name":"Representation Consistency（RC）","papers":[187876]},{"name":"MACO","papers":[428135]},{"name":"Multi-Agent Conversational Online Learning","papers":[428135]},{"name":"MACO-A","papers":[428135]},{"name":"MACO-S","papers":[428135]},{"name":"conversational bandit","papers":[428135]},{"name":"Twist decoding","papers":[64154]},{"name":"Ensemble LLMs via Vocabulary Alignment（EVA）","papers":[2329]},{"name":"GaC（Generation as Classification）Ensembling","papers":[62823]},{"name":"Co-LLM（Collaborative Decoding with Latent Variables）","papers":[228170]},{"name":"Reinforcement Learning-Assisted Ensemble（RLAE）","papers":[67312]},{"name":"DeePEn（Deep Parallel Ensemble）","papers":[180351]},{"name":"Cool-Fusion","papers":[232689]},{"name":"兼容性驱动的模型选择与 Union Top-k Ensembling（UniTE）","papers":[251129]},{"name":"SweetSpan","papers":[307456]},{"name":"FusionRoute","papers":[103377]},{"name":"CoRE（Consistency for Robust Ensemble）","papers":[164842]},{"name":"SAFE（Stable And Fast LLM Ensembling）","papers":[258500]},{"name":"Multi-Prompt Ensemble Decoding（M-Ped）","papers":[69624]},{"name":"Inner-Batch Ensemble","papers":[69624]},{"name":"Mixture-model-like Ensemble（ME）","papers":[102275]},{"name":"Lazy KV Cache Synchronization","papers":[102275]},{"name":"SkillAggregation","papers":[232924]},{"name":"Optimal Weight（OW）","papers":[98026]},{"name":"Inverse Surprising Popularity（ISP）","papers":[98026]},{"name":"OW-L","papers":[98026]},{"name":"OW-I","papers":[98026]},{"name":"自适应生成方案与多个 LLM 的加权集成","papers":[255455]}],"supporting_papers":[2329,62823,63422,64154,67312,69624,98026,102275,103377,163837,164842,164942,180351,187876,196497,206826,228170,228760,232689,232924,237185,248694,251129,255455,258500,258521,307456,428135],"paper_count":28}
{"id":"multi-llm-routing-ensemble-I0023","kind":"insight","unit":"multi-llm-routing-ensemble","unit_name":"多模型路由、级联与集成","statement":"文本任务上的LLM逐查询计算分配：依据难度、错误风险与增量收益，通过难度估计、相似成功样例检索、级联升级或强弱模型分工把请求分给不同能力的模型，可在接近强模型质量的同时降低成本（FORC、OrchestraLLM、Trigger³、HyFunc）。","mechanism":"估计逐查询的质量增益与成本，按难度、置信度或历史相似样例选择模型，必要时级联升级或复用已有输出。","scope":"文本分类、生成、问答、推理、排序、纠错、函数调用与代码生成等任务；模型间缺乏互补性或难度/风险估计失准时收益收窄。","techniques":[{"name":"TO-Router","papers":[62631]},{"name":"FORC（Fly-swat or cannon）","papers":[310211]},{"name":"MixLLM","papers":[5373]},{"name":"Expert-Token-Routing (ETR)","papers":[228083]},{"name":"Firewall Routing","papers":[66963]},{"name":"Select-then-Route (StR)","papers":[68546]},{"name":"基于置信度的逐实例提示搜索（confidence-based instance-level prompt search）","papers":[412001]},{"name":"Intelligent Prompt Routing（IPR）","papers":[68688]},{"name":"RadialRouter","papers":[69505]},{"name":"RouterEval","papers":[68926]},{"name":"PILOT（Preference-prior Informed LinUCB fOr Adaptive RouTing）及在线成本策略","papers":[70019]},{"name":"PAK-UCB；RFF-UCB","papers":[89669]},{"name":"BEST-Route","papers":[89779]},{"name":"因果端到端遗憾最小化框架","papers":[187403]},{"name":"PORT（Proposed Online Routing via Training-free optimization）","papers":[190773]},{"name":"STREAQ","papers":[68639]},{"name":"Cost-Spectrum Contrastive Routing（CSCR）","papers":[191405]},{"name":"IRT-Router","papers":[232929]},{"name":"Coke","papers":[180203]},{"name":"SelectLLM","papers":[235206]},{"name":"GraphRouter","papers":[248421]},{"name":"LLMRec","papers":[187277]},{"name":"TagRouter","papers":[235244]},{"name":"路由模型训练框架（摘要未提供专有名称）","papers":[248709]},{"name":"SCOPE（Scalable and Controllable Outcome Performance Estimator）","papers":[100970]},{"name":"R2-Router","papers":[102058]},{"name":"UniScale","papers":[103683]},{"name":"基于 RecSys 视角的模型路由框架与路线图","papers":[199054]},{"name":"EquiRouter","papers":[199487]},{"name":"Chain-of-Route（CoR）","papers":[202490]},{"name":"ConvoRouter","papers":[204282]},{"name":"ProxRouter","papers":[215861]},{"